From b1d96947cc848ddac8fe32d372c38e658bd09914 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DaffyDabz <daffydabz@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 14:14:08 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 014/371] Quests: port docking, named boss kills, choice
 offers, Black Pearl map, card rewards

- New QuestManagerAI.dockedAtPort, called per crew member from DistributedShipAI.dropAnchor
  (30 maroon / smuggle / deliver-to-port quests); a missing crew avatar is skipped, not asserted.
- New QuestManagerAI.npcDefeated from enemyDefeated, keyed on the boss spawn node (12 DefeatNPC quests).
- Quest choice offers: containers become QuestOffers and pendingOffers is always stored, so a pick works.
- Black Pearl treasure map and PirateInventoryAI.giveCards fixes so those quest steps finish.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 pirates/npc/DistributedNPCTownfolkAI.py       |  9 ++--
 pirates/quest/DistributedQuestGiverAI.py      | 18 ++++++-
 pirates/quest/QuestManagerAI.py               | 49 ++++++++++++++++++-
 pirates/ship/DistributedShipAI.py             | 10 +++-
 .../treasuremap/TreasureMapBlackPearlAI.py    |  5 ++
 pirates/uberdog/PirateInventoryAI.py          |  8 ++-
 6 files changed, 91 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

